# ::tok http : / / www . ted . com / talks / eddi_reader_sings_kiteflyer_s_hill< / url> <next_sent> This is about a place in London called Kiteflyer 's Hill where I used to go and spend hours going " When is he coming back ? When is he coming back ? " <next_sent> So this is another one dedicated to that guy ... <next_sent> who I 've got over . <next_sent> But this is " Kiteflyer 's Hill . " <next_sent> It 's a beautiful song written by a guy called Martin Evan , actually , for me . <next_sent> Boo Hewerdine , Thomas Dolby , thank you very much for inviting me . <next_sent> It 's been a blessing singing for you . <next_sent> Thank you very much .
